2.055" end="01:12.845">okay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.265" end="01:14.754"><span begin="01:13.265" end="01:13.475">And </span><span begin="01:13.475" end="01:13.715">he </span><span begin="01:13.715" end="01:13.935">walked </span><span begin="01:13.935" end="01:14.324">away </span><span begin="01:14.324" end="01:14.754">but</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.754" end="01:16.394"><span begin="01:14.754" end="01:14.944">His </span><span begin="01:14.944" end="01:15.144">smile </span><span begin="01:15.144" end="01:15.444">never </span><span begin="01:15.444" end="01:15.684">dimmed  </span><span begin="01:15.684" end="01:16.024">it </span><span begin="01:16.024" end="01:16.394">said</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.394" end="01:18.594"><span begin="01:16.394" end="01:16.644">I'm </span><span begin="01:16.644" end="01:16.934">gonna </span><span begin="01:16.934" end="01:17.194">be </span><span begin="01:17.194" end="01:17.544">like </span><span begin="01:17.544" end="01:18.663">him  </span><span begin="01:18.663" end="01:19.393">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.393" end="01:21.793"><span begin="01:19.393" end="01:19.623">You </span><span begin="01:19.623" end="01:19.813">know </span><span begin="01:19.813" end="01:20.013">I'm </span><span begin="01:20.013" end="01:20.223">gonna </span><span begin="01:20.223" end="01:20.543">be </span><span begin="01:20.543" end="01:20.903">like </span><span begin="01:20.903" end="01:21.793">him </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.873" end="01:25.583"><span begin="01:23.873" end="01:24.103">And </span><span begin="01:24.103" end="01:24.323">the </span><span begin="01:24.323" end="01:24.563">cat's </span><span begin="01:24.563" end="01:24.793">in </span><span begin="01:24.793" end="01:25.053">the </span><span begin="01:25.053" end="01:25.583">cradle </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.583" end="01:26.573"><span begin="01:25.583" end="01:25.833">And </span><span begin="01:25.833" end="0